{"title":"少年毛泽东","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1949,"month":6,"day":22}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米谷"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米谷作(二)毛家是一个贫农家庭，土地都已经典卖完了，父亲毛仁生，母亲文其美，还有老祖父，一家人终年劳苦，都不得温饱。"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}